      "title": {
        "zh": "受保护路径",
        "en": "Protected paths"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "把生产配置挡在 agent 工具之外：按分组登记目录与文件，工具调用在执行前被拒绝，父目录仍可列目录/glob/grep 且受保护条目自动剔除。策略级防护，非操作系统隔离。",
        "en": "Keeps production configuration out of agent tool calls: register directories and files per group; calls are denied before they run, while parent directories stay searchable with protected entries removed. Policy-level protection, not OS isolation."
